# Giving in the F-Droid build (README, Support). Builds read these unless the
# repository variables of the same names are set. With no giving page, the
# app shows nothing about giving.
# PESACLARITY_SUPPORT_URL: the https giving page; {amount} stands for the
#   amount in shillings when the page can take one.
# PESACLARITY_SUPPORT_PAYEES: the payee names or numbers a gift's M-Pesa
#   message shows, separated by commas, so the app can say thank you.
PESACLARITY_SUPPORT_URL=''
PESACLARITY_SUPPORT_PAYEES=''
PESACLARITY_SUPPORT_COSTS_URL='https://pesaclarity.github.io/sponsor/#why-title'
